{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745400/extras/540d13051943407e9025418f024662f0.avif?t=1763416273\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>Take on the role of <strong>Sherban</strong>, a regular dude who loves kebabs and expensive suits. One day, he's rushing to work and stops at his fave fast-food joint for a tasty kebab. He chomps down on it like a wild man, savoring every bite, when suddenly the kebab jumps out of his hands and takes off. Knowing that he's broke, he sets off after it, determined to catch that darn kebab.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745400/extras/9b4b6795352c8ad3dce5766038c85eb1.avif?t=1763416273\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>As you guide Sherban through the challenging levels in the streets of Bucharest, you'll need to use your skills to catch that runaway kebab. You'll face obstacles like trash, more trash, parked cars and guys carrying glass panes, but with some quick moves and good timing, you might catch that elusive kebab before it gets away.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/745400/extras/b46cc361df52d85f29b2dd6f3966d860.avif?t=1763416273\" width=600 height=94 /></span><br><br>The game also boasts a banger soundtrack that'll keep you grooving as you chase down that kebab. And if you're feeling creative, <strong>Kebab it Up!</strong> even has a level editor that lets you make your own levels or download levels from the game's community on Steam Workshop.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"2157fd5dfa85b96e15ad919db94c039a4bdb1268.jpg","localized_name":"Let's catch that!","name":"Let's catch that!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/745400/2157fd5dfa85b96e15ad919db94c039a4bdb1268.jpg"},{"ico